@export Under Article 5, as a provider of an AI system, is my placing on the market or putting into service of an AI system prohibited by Article 5(1)(g) (biometric categorisation to infer race, political opinions, trade union membership, religious or philosophical beliefs, sex life or sexual orientation)?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `I am putting the AI system into service rather than placing it on the market` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you putting the AI system into service (rather than placing it on the market)? Answer no if you are placing it on the market.
      `the putting into service is for this specific purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the putting into service is for this specific purpose?
      `the AI system is for the purpose of assigning natural persons to specific categories` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system for the purpose of assigning natural persons to specific categories? (An element of the definition of a biometric categorisation system, Article 3(40).)
      `the AI system assigns natural persons to specific categories on the basis of their biometric data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the AI system assign natural persons to specific categories on the basis of their biometric data? (Article 3(40).)
      `the categorisation is ancillary to another commercial service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the categorisation ancillary to another commercial service? (Article 3(40) leaves out a categorisation that is both ancillary to another commercial service and strictly necessary for objective technical reasons.)
      `the categorisation is strictly necessary for objective technical reasons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the categorisation strictly necessary for objective technical reasons? (Article 3(40).)
      `the AI system categorises natural persons individually` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the AI system categorise natural persons individually? (Article 5(1), point (g), speaks of systems that categorise individually.)
      `it categorises them to deduce or infer their race, political opinions, trade union membership, religious or philosophical beliefs, sex life or sexual orientation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that it categorises them to deduce or infer their race, political opinions, trade union membership, religious or philosophical beliefs, sex life or sexual orientation?
      `the data is personal data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the data personal data? (An element of the definition of biometric data, Article 3(34).)
      `the data results from specific technical processing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the data result from specific technical processing? (Article 3(34).)
      `the data relates to the physical, physiological or behavioural characteristics of a natural person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the data relate to the physical, physiological or behavioural characteristics of a natural person? (Article 3(34).)
      `the system does labelling or filtering of lawfully acquired datasets, such as images` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the system do labelling or filtering of lawfully acquired datasets, such as images?
      `the use is carried out by law enforcement authorities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the use carried out by law enforcement authorities? (An element of the definition of law enforcement, Article 3(46).)
      `the use is carried out on behalf of law enforcement authorities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the use carried out on behalf of law enforcement authorities? (Article 3(46).)
      `the use is for the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including safeguarding against and preventing threats to public security` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the use for the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including safeguarding against and preventing threats to public security? (Article 3(46).)
      `the system categorises the data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the system categorise that data?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 5, as a provider of an AI system, is my placing on the market or putting into service of an AI system prohibited by Article 5(1)(g) (biometric categorisation to infer race, political opinions, trade union membership, religious or philosophical beliefs, sex life or sexual orientation)` IS
    `Art 5(1)(g) the AI practice is prohibited` `the date asked` (IF `I am putting the AI system into service rather than placing it on the market` THEN `Art 5(1) act putting into service` ELSE `Art 5(1) act placing on the market`) `the putting into service is for this specific purpose` `the AI system is a biometric categorisation system that categorises individually natural persons based on their biometric data` `it categorises them to deduce or infer their race, political opinions, trade union membership, religious or philosophical beliefs, sex life or sexual orientation` `the system does labelling or filtering of lawfully acquired biometric datasets, such as images, based on biometric data` `the system categorises biometric data in the area of law enforcement`
    WHERE
        `the AI system is a biometric categorisation system that categorises individually natural persons based on their biometric data` MEANS
            (`Art 3(40) the AI system is a biometric categorisation system` TRUE `the AI system is for the purpose of assigning natural persons to specific categories` `the AI system assigns natural persons to specific categories on the basis of their biometric data` `the categorisation is ancillary to another commercial service` `the categorisation is strictly necessary for objective technical reasons`) AND (`the AI system categorises natural persons individually`)
        `the data is biometric data` MEANS
            `Art 3(34) the data is biometric data` `the data is personal data` `the data results from specific technical processing` `the data relates to the physical, physiological or behavioural characteristics of a natural person`
        `the system does labelling or filtering of lawfully acquired biometric datasets, such as images, based on biometric data` MEANS
            (`the system does labelling or filtering of lawfully acquired datasets, such as images`) AND (`the data is biometric data`)
        `the use is for the purposes of law enforcement` MEANS
            `Art 3(46) the activities are law enforcement` `the use is carried out by law enforcement authorities` `the use is carried out on behalf of law enforcement authorities` `the use is for the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including safeguarding against and preventing threats to public security`
        `the system categorises biometric data in the area of law enforcement` MEANS
            (`the system categorises the data`) AND (`the data is biometric data`) AND (`the use is for the purposes of law enforcement`)

§ `Under Article 6: is my AI system high-risk`

§§ `Applicability`

@export Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` IS
    JUST (`Art 113 the provision group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)

§§ `Article 6(1): the Annex I route`

@export Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system high-risk under Article 6(1) with Annex I?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the component is a component of a product or of an AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the part you are asking about a component of a product or of an AI system? (An element of the definition of a safety component, Article 3(14).)
      `the component fulfils a safety function for that product or AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the component fulfil a safety function for that product or AI system? (Article 3(14), as enacted.)
      `the component's failure or malfunctioning endangers the health and safety of persons or property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the failure or malfunctioning of the component endanger the health and safety of persons or property? (Article 3(14).)
      `the component's intended purpose is to prevent or mitigate risks to health and safety of persons or property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the intended purpose of the component to prevent or mitigate risks to the health and safety of persons or property? (Article 3(14), as amended.)
      `the AI system is solely used for non-safety related aspects of user assistance, performance optimisation, service efficiency, automation or convenience or quality control` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is solely used for non-safety related aspects of user assistance, performance optimisation, service efficiency, automation or convenience or quality control?
      `the failure or malfunctioning of the AI system would endanger health and safety` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the failure or malfunctioning of the AI system would endanger health and safety?
      `the AI system is itself a product` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is itself a product?
      `the Union harmonisation legislation that covers the product` IS AN `Annex I item` @desc Which item of Annex I lists the Union harmonisation legislation that covers the product? Choose the item that names the act (for example, the medical devices regulation), or the choice for no listed legislation.
      `the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists?
      `the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment, with a view to the placing on the market or the putting into service of that product pursuant to the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment, with a view to the placing on the market or the putting into service of that product pursuant to the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I?
      `the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment solely due to risks other than risks to health and safety` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment solely due to risks other than risks to health and safety?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system high-risk under Article 6(1) with Annex I` IS
    `Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` `the date asked` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the AI system is intended to be used as a safety component of a product` `the AI system is solely used for non-safety related aspects of user assistance, performance optimisation, service efficiency, automation or convenience or quality control` `the failure or malfunctioning of the AI system would endanger health and safety` `the AI system is itself a product` `the Union harmonisation legislation that covers the product` `the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists` `the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment, with a view to the placing on the market or the putting into service of that product pursuant to the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I` `the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment solely due to risks other than risks to health and safety`
    WHERE
        `the AI system is intended to be used as a safety component of a product` MEANS
            `Art 3(14) the component is a safety component` `the date asked` `the component is a component of a product or of an AI system` `the component fulfils a safety function for that product or AI system` `the component's failure or malfunctioning endangers the health and safety of persons or property` `the component's intended purpose is to prevent or mitigate risks to health and safety of persons or property`

§§ `Article 6(2) and (3): the Annex III route`

@export Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system high-risk under Article 6(2) and (3) with Annex III?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the AI system is referred to in Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is referred to in Annex III?
      `the AI system performs profiling of natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system performs profiling of natural persons?
      `the AI system does not pose a significant risk of harm to the health, safety or fundamental rights of natural persons, including by not materially influencing the outcome of decision making` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system does not pose a significant risk of harm to the health, safety or fundamental rights of natural persons, including by not materially influencing the outcome of decision making?
      `the AI system is intended to perform a narrow procedural task` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to perform a narrow procedural task?
      `the AI system is intended to improve the result of a previously completed human activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to improve the result of a previously completed human activity?
      `the AI system is intended to detect decision-making patterns or deviations from prior decision-making patterns and is not meant to replace or influence the previously completed human assessment, without proper human review` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to detect decision-making patterns or deviations from prior decision-making patterns and is not meant to replace or influence the previously completed human assessment, without proper human review?
      `the AI system is intended to perform a preparatory task to an assessment relevant for the purposes of the use cases listed in Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to perform a preparatory task to an assessment relevant for the purposes of the use cases listed in Annex III?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system high-risk under Article 6(2) and (3) with Annex III` IS
    `Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` `the date asked` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the AI system is referred to in Annex III` `the AI system performs profiling of natural persons` `the AI system does not pose a significant risk of harm to the health, safety or fundamental rights of natural persons, including by not materially influencing the outcome of decision making` `the AI system is intended to perform a narrow procedural task` `the AI system is intended to improve the result of a previously completed human activity` `the AI system is intended to detect decision-making patterns or deviations from prior decision-making patterns and is not meant to replace or influence the previously completed human assessment, without proper human review` `the AI system is intended to perform a preparatory task to an assessment relevant for the purposes of the use cases listed in Annex III`

§§ `Article 6: the route`

@export Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by which route is my AI system high-risk under Article 6: Article 6(1) with Annex I, Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the component is a component of a product or of an AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the part you are asking about a component of a product or of an AI system? (An element of the definition of a safety component, Article 3(14).)
      `the component fulfils a safety function for that product or AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the component fulfil a safety function for that product or AI system? (Article 3(14), as enacted.)
      `the component's failure or malfunctioning endangers the health and safety of persons or property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the failure or malfunctioning of the component endanger the health and safety of persons or property? (Article 3(14).)
      `the component's intended purpose is to prevent or mitigate risks to health and safety of persons or property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the intended purpose of the component to prevent or mitigate risks to the health and safety of persons or property? (Article 3(14), as amended.)
      `the AI system is solely used for non-safety related aspects of user assistance, performance optimisation, service efficiency, automation or convenience or quality control` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is solely used for non-safety related aspects of user assistance, performance optimisation, service efficiency, automation or convenience or quality control?
      `the failure or malfunctioning of the AI system would endanger health and safety` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the failure or malfunctioning of the AI system would endanger health and safety?
      `the AI system is itself a product` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is itself a product?
      `the Union harmonisation legislation that covers the product` IS AN `Annex I item` @desc Which item of Annex I lists the Union harmonisation legislation that covers the product? Choose the item that names the act (for example, the medical devices regulation), or the choice for no listed legislation.
      `the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists?
      `the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment, with a view to the placing on the market or the putting into service of that product pursuant to the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment, with a view to the placing on the market or the putting into service of that product pursuant to the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I?
      `the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment solely due to risks other than risks to health and safety` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment solely due to risks other than risks to health and safety?
      `the AI system is referred to in Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is referred to in Annex III?
      `the AI system performs profiling of natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system performs profiling of natural persons?
      `the AI system does not pose a significant risk of harm to the health, safety or fundamental rights of natural persons, including by not materially influencing the outcome of decision making` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system does not pose a significant risk of harm to the health, safety or fundamental rights of natural persons, including by not materially influencing the outcome of decision making?
      `the AI system is intended to perform a narrow procedural task` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to perform a narrow procedural task?
      `the AI system is intended to improve the result of a previously completed human activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to improve the result of a previously completed human activity?
      `the AI system is intended to detect decision-making patterns or deviations from prior decision-making patterns and is not meant to replace or influence the previously completed human assessment, without proper human review` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to detect decision-making patterns or deviations from prior decision-making patterns and is not meant to replace or influence the previously completed human assessment, without proper human review?
      `the AI system is intended to perform a preparatory task to an assessment relevant for the purposes of the use cases listed in Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to perform a preparatory task to an assessment relevant for the purposes of the use cases listed in Annex III?
GIVETH A MAYBE `Route to high-risk`
DECIDE `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by which route is my AI system high-risk under Article 6: Article 6(1) with Annex I, Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither` IS
    `Art 6 the route by which the AI system is high-risk` (`Art 6(1) the AI system is high-risk` `the date asked` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the AI system is intended to be used as a safety component of a product` `the AI system is solely used for non-safety related aspects of user assistance, performance optimisation, service efficiency, automation or convenience or quality control` `the failure or malfunctioning of the AI system would endanger health and safety` `the AI system is itself a product` `the Union harmonisation legislation that covers the product` `the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists` `the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment, with a view to the placing on the market or the putting into service of that product pursuant to the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I` `the product is required to undergo a third-party conformity assessment solely due to risks other than risks to health and safety`) (`Art 6(2) the AI system is high-risk` `the date asked` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the AI system is referred to in Annex III` `the AI system performs profiling of natural persons` `the AI system does not pose a significant risk of harm to the health, safety or fundamental rights of natural persons, including by not materially influencing the outcome of decision making` `the AI system is intended to perform a narrow procedural task` `the AI system is intended to improve the result of a previously completed human activity` `the AI system is intended to detect decision-making patterns or deviations from prior decision-making patterns and is not meant to replace or influence the previously completed human assessment, without proper human review` `the AI system is intended to perform a preparatory task to an assessment relevant for the purposes of the use cases listed in Annex III`)
    WHERE
        `the AI system is intended to be used as a safety component of a product` MEANS
            `Art 3(14) the component is a safety component` `the date asked` `the component is a component of a product or of an AI system` `the component fulfils a safety function for that product or AI system` `the component's failure or malfunctioning endangers the health and safety of persons or property` `the component's intended purpose is to prevent or mitigate risks to health and safety of persons or property`

§§ `Article 6(4): an assessment that the system is not high-risk`

@export Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, am I subject to the registration obligation set out in Article 49(2) because I consider my Annex III system not high-risk?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the provider considers that an AI system referred to in Annex III is not high-risk` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the provider considers that an AI system referred to in Annex III is not high-risk?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, am I subject to the registration obligation set out in Article 49(2) because I consider my Annex III system not high-risk` IS
    `Art 6(4) the provider is subject to the registration obligation set out in Article 49(2)` `the date asked` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the provider considers that an AI system referred to in Annex III is not high-risk`

@export Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by what last day must I document my assessment that my Annex III system is not high-risk, so that it is documented before the placing on the market?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the provider considers that an AI system referred to in Annex III is not high-risk` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the provider considers that an AI system referred to in Annex III is not high-risk?
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by what last day must I document my assessment that my Annex III system is not high-risk, so that it is documented before the placing on the market` IS
    `Art 6(4) the last day on which the assessment can be documented before the placing` `the date asked` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the provider considers that an AI system referred to in Annex III is not high-risk`

§ `Under Article 7: what the Commission's power over Annex III means to a provider`

§§ `Article 7(1): adding use-cases`

@export Under Article 7, as a provider of an AI system, may the Commission adopt a delegated act adding or modifying use-cases of high-risk AI systems to cover my AI system?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the AI systems are intended to be used in any of the areas listed in Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI systems are intended to be used in any of the areas listed in Annex III?
      `the AI systems pose a risk of harm to health and safety, or an adverse impact on fundamental rights` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI systems pose a risk of harm to health and safety, or an adverse impact on fundamental rights?
      `that risk is equivalent to, or greater than, the risk of harm or of adverse impact posed by the high-risk AI systems already referred to in Annex III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that that risk is equivalent to, or greater than, the risk of harm or of adverse impact posed by the high-risk AI systems already referred to in Annex III?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 7, as a provider of an AI system, may the Commission adopt a delegated act adding or modifying use-cases of high-risk AI systems to cover my AI system` IS
    `Art 7(1) the Commission may adopt delegated acts adding or modifying use-cases of high-risk AI systems` `the date asked` `the AI systems are intended to be used in any of the areas listed in Annex III` `the AI systems pose a risk of harm to health and safety, or an adverse impact on fundamental rights` `that risk is equivalent to, or greater than, the risk of harm or of adverse impact posed by the high-risk AI systems already referred to in Annex III`

§§ `Article 7(3): removing high-risk AI systems`

@export Under Article 7, as a provider of an AI system, may the Commission adopt a delegated act removing my AI system from the list in Annex III?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the high-risk AI system concerned no longer poses any significant risks to fundamental rights, health or safety, taking into account the criteria listed in paragraph 2` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the high-risk AI system concerned no longer poses any significant risks to fundamental rights, health or safety, taking into account the criteria listed in paragraph 2?
      `the deletion does not decrease the overall level of protection of health, safety and fundamental rights under Union law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the deletion does not decrease the overall level of protection of health, safety and fundamental rights under Union law?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 7, as a provider of an AI system, may the Commission adopt a delegated act removing my AI system from the list in Annex III` IS
    `Art 7(3) the Commission may adopt delegated acts removing high-risk AI systems from the list in Annex III` `the date asked` `the high-risk AI system concerned no longer poses any significant risks to fundamental rights, health or safety, taking into account the criteria listed in paragraph 2` `the deletion does not decrease the overall level of protection of health, safety and fundamental rights under Union law`

§ `Under Annex III: the high-risk areas`

§§ `Annex III point 1`

@export Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)?
GIVEN `the AI system is for the purpose of identifying natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system for the purpose of identifying natural persons? (An element of the definition of a remote biometric identification system, Article 3(41).)
      `the AI system identifies natural persons without their active involvement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the AI system identify natural persons without their active involvement? (Article 3(41).)
      `the AI system identifies natural persons through the comparison of a person's biometric data with the biometric data contained in a reference database` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the AI system identify natural persons by comparing a person's biometric data with the biometric data contained in a reference database? (Article 3(41).)
      `the verification is automated` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the verification automated? (An element of the definition of biometric verification, Article 3(36).)
      `the verification is one-to-one` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the verification one-to-one? (Article 3(36).)
      `the verification is a verification, including authentication, of the identity of natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a verification, including an authentication, of the identity of natural persons? (Article 3(36).)
      `the verification is by comparing the biometric data of natural persons to previously provided biometric data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the verification made by comparing the biometric data of natural persons to previously provided biometric data? (Article 3(36).)
      `the sole purpose of the biometric verification is to confirm that a specific natural person is the person he or she claims to be` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the sole purpose of the biometric verification is to confirm that a specific natural person is the person he or she claims to be?
      `the AI system is for the purpose of assigning natural persons to specific categories` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system for the purpose of assigning natural persons to specific categories? (An element of the definition of a biometric categorisation system, Article 3(40).)
      `the AI system assigns natural persons to specific categories on the basis of their biometric data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the AI system assign natural persons to specific categories on the basis of their biometric data? (Article 3(40).)
      `the categorisation is ancillary to another commercial service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the categorisation ancillary to another commercial service? (Article 3(40) leaves out a categorisation that is both ancillary to another commercial service and strictly necessary for objective technical reasons.)
      `the categorisation is strictly necessary for objective technical reasons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the categorisation strictly necessary for objective technical reasons? (Article 3(40).)
      `the categorisation is according to sensitive or protected attributes or characteristics based on the inference of those attributes or characteristics` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the categorisation is according to sensitive or protected attributes or characteristics based on the inference of those attributes or characteristics?
      `the AI system is for the purpose of identifying or inferring emotions or intentions of natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system for the purpose of identifying or inferring emotions or intentions of natural persons? (An element of the definition of an emotion recognition system, Article 3(39).)
      `the AI system identifies or infers emotions or intentions of natural persons on the basis of their biometric data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the AI system identify or infer those emotions or intentions on the basis of the biometric data of natural persons? (Article 3(39).)
      `the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` IS
    `Annex III point 1 the AI system is listed in the area` (`Annex III point 1(a) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is a remote biometric identification system` `the AI system is intended to be used for biometric verification` `the sole purpose of the biometric verification is to confirm that a specific natural person is the person he or she claims to be`) (`Annex III point 1(b) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used for biometric categorisation` `the categorisation is according to sensitive or protected attributes or characteristics based on the inference of those attributes or characteristics`) (`Annex III point 1(c) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used for emotion recognition`) `the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law`
    WHERE
        `the AI system is a remote biometric identification system` MEANS
            `Art 3(41) the AI system is a remote biometric identification system` TRUE `the AI system is for the purpose of identifying natural persons` `the AI system identifies natural persons without their active involvement` `the AI system identifies natural persons through the comparison of a person's biometric data with the biometric data contained in a reference database`
        `the AI system is intended to be used for biometric verification` MEANS
            `Art 3(36) the verification is a biometric verification` `the verification is automated` `the verification is one-to-one` `the verification is a verification, including authentication, of the identity of natural persons` `the verification is by comparing the biometric data of natural persons to previously provided biometric data`
        `the AI system is intended to be used for biometric categorisation` MEANS
            `Art 3(40) the AI system is a biometric categorisation system` TRUE `the AI system is for the purpose of assigning natural persons to specific categories` `the AI system assigns natural persons to specific categories on the basis of their biometric data` `the categorisation is ancillary to another commercial service` `the categorisation is strictly necessary for objective technical reasons`
        `the AI system is intended to be used for emotion recognition` MEANS
            `Art 3(39) the AI system is an emotion recognition system` TRUE `the AI system is for the purpose of identifying or inferring emotions or intentions of natural persons` `the AI system identifies or infers emotions or intentions of natural persons on the basis of their biometric data`

§§ `Annex III point 2`

@export Under Annex III point 2, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 2 of Annex III (critical infrastructure)?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the component is a component of a product or of an AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the part you are asking about a component of a product or of an AI system? (An element of the definition of a safety component, Article 3(14).)
      `the component fulfils a safety function for that product or AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the component fulfil a safety function for that product or AI system? (Article 3(14), as enacted.)
      `the component's failure or malfunctioning endangers the health and safety of persons or property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the failure or malfunctioning of the component endanger the health and safety of persons or property? (Article 3(14).)
      `the component's intended purpose is to prevent or mitigate risks to health and safety of persons or property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the intended purpose of the component to prevent or mitigate risks to the health and safety of persons or property? (Article 3(14), as amended.)
      `the safety component is in the management and operation of critical digital infrastructure` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the safety component is in the management and operation of critical digital infrastructure?
      `the safety component is in the management and operation of road traffic` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the safety component is in the management and operation of road traffic?
      `the safety component is in the supply of water, gas, heating or electricity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the safety component is in the supply of water, gas, heating or electricity?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex III point 2, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 2 of Annex III (critical infrastructure)` IS
    `Annex III point 2 the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used as a safety component` `the safety component is in the management and operation of critical digital infrastructure` `the safety component is in the management and operation of road traffic` `the safety component is in the supply of water, gas, heating or electricity`
    WHERE
        `the AI system is intended to be used as a safety component` MEANS
            `Art 3(14) the component is a safety component` `the date asked` `the component is a component of a product or of an AI system` `the component fulfils a safety function for that product or AI system` `the component's failure or malfunctioning endangers the health and safety of persons or property` `the component's intended purpose is to prevent or mitigate risks to health and safety of persons or property`

§§ `Annex III point 3`

@export Under Annex III point 3, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 3 of Annex III (education and vocational training)?
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used to determine access or admission to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to determine access or admission to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to assign natural persons to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to assign natural persons to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate learning outcomes` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate learning outcomes?
      `the AI system is intended to be used for the purpose of assessing the appropriate level of education that an individual will receive or will be able to access` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used for the purpose of assessing the appropriate level of education that an individual will receive or will be able to access?
      `the assessment is in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the assessment is in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels?
      `the AI system is intended to be used for monitoring and detecting prohibited behaviour of students during tests` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used for monitoring and detecting prohibited behaviour of students during tests?
      `the monitoring is in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the monitoring is in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex III point 3, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 3 of Annex III (education and vocational training)` IS
    `Annex III point 3 the AI system is listed in the area` (`Annex III point 3(a) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used to determine access or admission to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels` `the AI system is intended to be used to assign natural persons to educational and vocational training institutions at all levels`) (`Annex III point 3(b) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate learning outcomes`) (`Annex III point 3(c) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used for the purpose of assessing the appropriate level of education that an individual will receive or will be able to access` `the assessment is in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels`) (`Annex III point 3(d) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used for monitoring and detecting prohibited behaviour of students during tests` `the monitoring is in the context of or within educational and vocational training institutions at all levels`)

§§ `Annex III point 4`

@export Under Annex III point 4, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 4 of Annex III (employment, workers' management and access to self-employment)?
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used for the recruitment or selection of natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used for the recruitment or selection of natural persons?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to make decisions affecting terms of work-related relationships, the promotion or termination of work-related contractual relationships` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to make decisions affecting terms of work-related relationships, the promotion or termination of work-related contractual relationships?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to allocate tasks based on individual behaviour or personal traits or characteristics` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to allocate tasks based on individual behaviour or personal traits or characteristics?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to monitor and evaluate the performance and behaviour of persons in such relationships` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to monitor and evaluate the performance and behaviour of persons in such relationships?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex III point 4, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 4 of Annex III (employment, workers' management and access to self-employment)` IS
    `Annex III point 4 the AI system is listed in the area` (`Annex III point 4(a) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used for the recruitment or selection of natural persons`) (`Annex III point 4(b) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used to make decisions affecting terms of work-related relationships, the promotion or termination of work-related contractual relationships` `the AI system is intended to be used to allocate tasks based on individual behaviour or personal traits or characteristics` `the AI system is intended to be used to monitor and evaluate the performance and behaviour of persons in such relationships`)

§§ `Annex III point 5`

@export Under Annex III point 5, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 5 of Annex III (access to and enjoyment of essential private services and essential public services and benefits)?
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used by public authorities or on behalf of public authorities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used by public authorities or on behalf of public authorities?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the eligibility of natural persons for essential public assistance benefits and services, including healthcare services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the eligibility of natural persons for essential public assistance benefits and services, including healthcare services?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to grant, reduce, revoke, or reclaim such benefits and services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to grant, reduce, revoke, or reclaim such benefits and services?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the creditworthiness of natural persons or establish their credit score` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the creditworthiness of natural persons or establish their credit score?
      `the AI system is used for the purpose of detecting financial fraud` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is used for the purpose of detecting financial fraud?
      `the AI system is intended to be used for risk assessment and pricing in relation to natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used for risk assessment and pricing in relation to natural persons?
      `the risk assessment and pricing is in the case of life and health insurance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the risk assessment and pricing is in the case of life and health insurance?
      `the AI system is intended to evaluate and classify emergency calls by natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to evaluate and classify emergency calls by natural persons?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to dispatch, or to establish priority in the dispatching of, emergency first response services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to dispatch, or to establish priority in the dispatching of, emergency first response services?
      `the AI system is an emergency healthcare patient triage system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is an emergency healthcare patient triage system?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex III point 5, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 5 of Annex III (access to and enjoyment of essential private services and essential public services and benefits)` IS
    `Annex III point 5 the AI system is listed in the area` (`Annex III point 5(a) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used by public authorities or on behalf of public authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the eligibility of natural persons for essential public assistance benefits and services, including healthcare services` `the AI system is intended to be used to grant, reduce, revoke, or reclaim such benefits and services`) (`Annex III point 5(b) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the creditworthiness of natural persons or establish their credit score` `the AI system is used for the purpose of detecting financial fraud`) (`Annex III point 5(c) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used for risk assessment and pricing in relation to natural persons` `the risk assessment and pricing is in the case of life and health insurance`) (`Annex III point 5(d) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to evaluate and classify emergency calls by natural persons` `the AI system is intended to be used to dispatch, or to establish priority in the dispatching of, emergency first response services` `the AI system is an emergency healthcare patient triage system`)

§§ `Annex III point 6`

@export Under Annex III point 6, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 6 of Annex III (law enforcement, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)?
GIVEN `the body is a public authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the body a public authority? ('The body' is the authority that is to use the AI system, or on whose behalf it is used, or that the Union institution supports. An element of the definition of a law enforcement authority, Article 3(45), point (a).)
      `the body is competent for the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including the safeguarding against and the prevention of threats to public security` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the body competent for the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including the safeguarding against and the prevention of threats to public security? (Article 3(45), point (a).)
      `the body is any other body or entity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the body any other body or entity, that is, not a public authority? (Article 3(45), point (b).)
      `the body is entrusted by Member State law to exercise public authority and public powers for the purposes of the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including the safeguarding against and the prevention of threats to public security` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the body entrusted by Member State law to exercise public authority and public powers for the purposes of the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including the safeguarding against and the prevention of threats to public security? (Article 3(45), point (b).)
      `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of the body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system intended to be used by, or on behalf of, the body described in the next questions? (Annex III point 6.)
      `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of the body or on its behalf` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of the body described in the next questions, or on its behalf? (Annex III point 6, point (a).)
      `the AI system is intended to be used to assess the risk of a natural person becoming the victim of criminal offences` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to assess the risk of a natural person becoming the victim of criminal offences?
      `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of the body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of the body described in the next questions? (Annex III point 6, points (b) to (e).)
      `the AI system is intended to be used as a polygraph or similar tool` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used as a polygraph or similar tool?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the reliability of evidence in the course of the investigation or prosecution of criminal offences` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the reliability of evidence in the course of the investigation or prosecution of criminal offences?
      `the AI system is intended to be used for assessing the risk of a natural person offending or re-offending` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used for assessing the risk of a natural person offending or re-offending?
      `the assessment is not solely on the basis of the profiling of natural persons as referred to in Article 3(4) of Directive (EU) 2016/680` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the assessment is not solely on the basis of the profiling of natural persons as referred to in Article 3(4) of Directive (EU) 2016/680?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to assess personality traits and characteristics or past criminal behaviour of natural persons or groups` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to assess personality traits and characteristics or past criminal behaviour of natural persons or groups?
      `the AI system is intended to be used for the profiling of natural persons as referred to in Article 3(4) of Directive (EU) 2016/680` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used for the profiling of natural persons as referred to in Article 3(4) of Directive (EU) 2016/680?
      `the profiling is in the course of the detection, investigation or prosecution of criminal offences` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the profiling is in the course of the detection, investigation or prosecution of criminal offences?
      `the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex III point 6, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 6 of Annex III (law enforcement, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` IS
    `Annex III point 6 the AI system is listed in the area` (`Annex III point 6(a) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities or on their behalf` `the AI system is intended to be used to assess the risk of a natural person becoming the victim of criminal offences`) (`Annex III point 6(b) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used as a polygraph or similar tool`) (`Annex III point 6(c) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used to evaluate the reliability of evidence in the course of the investigation or prosecution of criminal offences`) (`Annex III point 6(d) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used by law enforcement authorities or on their behalf` `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used for assessing the risk of a natural person offending or re-offending` `the assessment is not solely on the basis of the profiling of natural persons as referred to in Article 3(4) of Directive (EU) 2016/680` `the AI system is intended to be used to assess personality traits and characteristics or past criminal behaviour of natural persons or groups`) (`Annex III point 6(e) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used for the profiling of natural persons as referred to in Article 3(4) of Directive (EU) 2016/680` `the profiling is in the course of the detection, investigation or prosecution of criminal offences`) `the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law`
    WHERE
        `the body is a law enforcement authority` MEANS
            `Art 3(45) the body is a law enforcement authority` (`Art 3(45)(a) the body is a law enforcement authority as a public authority` `the body is a public authority` `the body is competent for the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including the safeguarding against and the prevention of threats to public security`) (`Art 3(45)(b) the body is a law enforcement authority as another entrusted body` `the body is any other body or entity` `the body is entrusted by Member State law to exercise public authority and public powers for the purposes of the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including the safeguarding against and the prevention of threats to public security`)
        `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of law enforcement authorities` MEANS
            (`the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of the body`) AND (`the body is a law enforcement authority`)
        `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities or on their behalf` MEANS
            (`the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of the body or on its behalf`) AND (`the body is a law enforcement authority`)
        `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of law enforcement authorities` MEANS
            (`the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies in support of the body`) AND (`the body is a law enforcement authority`)
        `the AI system is intended to be used by law enforcement authorities or on their behalf` MEANS
            (`the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of the body`) AND (`the body is a law enforcement authority`)

§§ `Annex III point 7`

@export Under Annex III point 7, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 7 of Annex III (migration, asylum and border control management, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)?
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of competent public authorities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of competent public authorities?
      `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies?
      `the AI system is intended to be used as a polygraph or similar tool` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used as a polygraph or similar tool?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to assess a risk, including a security risk, a risk of irregular migration, or a health risk` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to assess a risk, including a security risk, a risk of irregular migration, or a health risk?
      `the risk is posed by a natural person who intends to enter or who has entered into the territory of a Member State` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the risk is posed by a natural person who intends to enter or who has entered into the territory of a Member State?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to assist competent public authorities for the examination of applications for asylum, visa or residence permits and for associated complaints with regard to the eligibility of the natural persons applying for a status` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to assist competent public authorities for the examination of applications for asylum, visa or residence permits and for associated complaints with regard to the eligibility of the natural persons applying for a status?
      `the AI system is intended to be used in the context of migration, asylum or border control management` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used in the context of migration, asylum or border control management?
      `the AI system is intended to be used for the purpose of detecting, recognising or identifying natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used for the purpose of detecting, recognising or identifying natural persons?
      `the use is the verification of travel documents` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the use is the verification of travel documents?
      `the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex III point 7, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 7 of Annex III (migration, asylum and border control management, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` IS
    `Annex III point 7 the AI system is listed in the area` (`Annex III point 7(a) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of competent public authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies` `the AI system is intended to be used as a polygraph or similar tool`) (`Annex III point 7(b) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of competent public authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies` `the AI system is intended to be used to assess a risk, including a security risk, a risk of irregular migration, or a health risk` `the risk is posed by a natural person who intends to enter or who has entered into the territory of a Member State`) (`Annex III point 7(c) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of competent public authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies` `the AI system is intended to be used to assist competent public authorities for the examination of applications for asylum, visa or residence permits and for associated complaints with regard to the eligibility of the natural persons applying for a status`) (`Annex III point 7(d) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used by or on behalf of competent public authorities` `the AI system is intended to be used by Union institutions, bodies, offices or agencies` `the AI system is intended to be used in the context of migration, asylum or border control management` `the AI system is intended to be used for the purpose of detecting, recognising or identifying natural persons` `the use is the verification of travel documents`) `the use of the AI system is permitted under relevant Union or national law`

§§ `Annex III point 8`

@export Under Annex III point 8, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 8 of Annex III (administration of justice and democratic processes)?
GIVEN `the AI system is intended to be used by a judicial authority or on their behalf` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used by a judicial authority or on their behalf?
      `the AI system is intended to be used to assist a judicial authority in researching and interpreting facts and the law and in applying the law to a concrete set of facts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used to assist a judicial authority in researching and interpreting facts and the law and in applying the law to a concrete set of facts?
      `the AI system is intended to be used in a similar way in alternative dispute resolution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used in a similar way in alternative dispute resolution?
      `the AI system is intended to be used for influencing the outcome of an election or referendum or the voting behaviour of natural persons in the exercise of their vote in elections or referenda` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the AI system is intended to be used for influencing the outcome of an election or referendum or the voting behaviour of natural persons in the exercise of their vote in elections or referenda?
      `natural persons are not directly exposed to the output of the AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that natural persons are not directly exposed to the output of the AI system?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex III point 8, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 8 of Annex III (administration of justice and democratic processes)` IS
    `Annex III point 8 the AI system is listed in the area` (`Annex III point 8(a) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used by a judicial authority or on their behalf` `the AI system is intended to be used to assist a judicial authority in researching and interpreting facts and the law and in applying the law to a concrete set of facts` `the AI system is intended to be used in a similar way in alternative dispute resolution`) (`Annex III point 8(b) the AI system is listed` `the AI system is intended to be used for influencing the outcome of an election or referendum or the voting behaviour of natural persons in the exercise of their vote in elections or referenda` `natural persons are not directly exposed to the output of the AI system`)

-- ====================================================================================================
-- seat questions of seat provider from part P2 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- P2-seat-provider.l4: the seat of a provider of an AI system, over the layer-1 modules of part P2 (Article 4a, Articles 8 to 15, Annex IV).
-- It calls the layer-1 rules and never restates one. Every question has @export and @desc and takes plain inputs; the records a rule expects are built in a WHERE.
-- The shared inputs have the same names and @desc in every question: the date asked; the route by which the AI system is high-risk; the date it was placed on the market or put into service; whether its design was significantly changed since Chapter III applied.
-- A result of NOTHING is "not covered" (not yet applicable, saved by Article 111(2), or outside what the text says); JUST FALSE is the text's own "no".
-- The seat assumes its role: the person asking holds it (the role question below calls the keel's definition once).

§ `The role and the applicability of the provisions`

@export Under Article 4a, as a provider of an AI system, am I a provider within the meaning of Article 3(3)?
GIVEN `the party develops an AI system or a general-purpose AI model` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop an AI system or a general-purpose AI model?
      `the party has an AI system or a general-purpose AI model developed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have an AI system or a general-purpose AI model developed for you?
      `the party places it on the market, or puts the AI system into service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you place it on the market, or put the AI system into service?
      `the party does so under its own name or trademark` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you do so under your own name or trademark?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4a, as a provider of an AI system, am I a provider within the meaning of Article 3(3)` IS
    JUST (`Art 3(3) the party is a provider` `the party develops an AI system or a general-purpose AI model` `the party has an AI system or a general-purpose AI model developed` `the party places it on the market, or puts the AI system into service` `the party does so under its own name or trademark`)

@export Under Article 4a, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter I apply on the date asked?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4a, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` IS
    JUST (`Art 113 the provision group applies` `Chapter I` `the date asked` `the route to pass when no AI system is in question` `the date to pass when no AI system is in question` FALSE)

@export Under Article 8, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 8, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` IS
    JUST (`Art 113 the provision group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)


§ `Under Annex IV: the technical documentation`

@export Under Annex IV point 1, as a provider of an AI system, does the technical documentation of my high-risk AI system contain a general description of the AI system including the eight items the point lists?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system?
      `the technical documentation contains its intended purpose, the name of the provider and the version of the system reflecting its relation to previous versions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains its intended purpose, the name of the provider and the version of the system reflecting its relation to previous versions?
      `the technical documentation contains how the AI system interacts with, or can be used to interact with, hardware or software, including with other AI systems, that are not part of the AI system itself, where applicable` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain how the AI system interacts with, or can be used to interact with, hardware or software, including with other AI systems, that are not part of the AI system itself, where that is applicable? Answer yes if it is not applicable.
      `the technical documentation contains the versions of relevant software or firmware, and any requirements related to version updates` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the versions of relevant software or firmware, and any requirements related to version updates?
      `the technical documentation contains the description of all the forms in which the AI system is placed on the market or put into service, such as software packages embedded into hardware, downloads, or APIs` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the description of all the forms in which the AI system is placed on the market or put into service, such as software packages embedded into hardware, downloads, or APIs?
      `the technical documentation contains the description of the hardware on which the AI system is intended to run` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the description of the hardware on which the AI system is intended to run?
      `the technical documentation contains where the AI system is a component of products, photographs or illustrations showing external features, the marking and internal layout of those products` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain where the AI system is a component of products, photographs or illustrations showing external features, the marking and internal layout of those products? Answer yes if it is not a component of products.
      `the technical documentation contains a basic description of the user-interface provided to the deployer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains a basic description of the user-interface provided to the deployer?
      `the technical documentation contains instructions for use for the deployer, and a basic description of the user-interface provided to the deployer, where applicable` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain instructions for use for the deployer, and a basic description of the user-interface provided to the deployer, where that is applicable? Answer yes if it is not applicable.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex IV point 1, as a provider of an AI system, does the technical documentation of my high-risk AI system contain a general description of the AI system including the eight items the point lists` IS
    `Annex IV point 1 the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the technical documentation contains a general description of the AI system` `the technical documentation contains its intended purpose, the name of the provider and the version of the system reflecting its relation to previous versions` `the technical documentation contains how the AI system interacts with, or can be used to interact with, hardware or software, including with other AI systems, that are not part of the AI system itself, where applicable` `the technical documentation contains the versions of relevant software or firmware, and any requirements related to version updates` `the technical documentation contains the description of all the forms in which the AI system is placed on the market or put into service, such as software packages embedded into hardware, downloads, or APIs` `the technical documentation contains the description of the hardware on which the AI system is intended to run` `the technical documentation contains where the AI system is a component of products, photographs or illustrations showing external features, the marking and internal layout of those products` `the technical documentation contains a basic description of the user-interface provided to the deployer` `the technical documentation contains instructions for use for the deployer, and a basic description of the user-interface provided to the deployer, where applicable`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

@export Under Annex IV point 2, as a provider of an AI system, does the technical documentation of my high-risk AI system contain a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development, including the eight items the point lists?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development?
      `the technical documentation contains the methods and steps performed for the development of the AI system, including, where relevant, recourse to pre-trained systems or tools provided by third parties and how those were used, integrated or modified by the provider` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain the methods and steps performed for the development of the AI system, including, where relevant, recourse to pre-trained systems or tools provided by third parties and how those were used, integrated or modified by the provider? Answer yes if it is not relevant.
      `the technical documentation contains the design specifications of the system, namely the general logic of the AI system and of the algorithms` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the design specifications of the system, namely the general logic of the AI system and of the algorithms?
      `the technical documentation contains the key design choices including the rationale and assumptions made, including with regard to persons or groups of persons in respect of who the system is intended to be used` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the key design choices including the rationale and assumptions made, including with regard to persons or groups of persons in respect of who the system is intended to be used?
      `the technical documentation contains the main classification choices` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the main classification choices?
      `the technical documentation contains what the system is designed to optimise for, and the relevance of the different parameters` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains what the system is designed to optimise for, and the relevance of the different parameters?
      `the technical documentation contains the description of the expected output and output quality of the system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the description of the expected output and output quality of the system?
      `the technical documentation contains the decisions about any possible trade-off made regarding the technical solutions adopted to comply with the requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the decisions about any possible trade-off made regarding the technical solutions adopted to comply with the requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2?
      `the technical documentation contains the description of the system architecture explaining how software components build on or feed into each other and integrate into the overall processing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the description of the system architecture explaining how software components build on or feed into each other and integrate into the overall processing?
      `the technical documentation contains the computational resources used to develop, train, test and validate the AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the computational resources used to develop, train, test and validate the AI system?
      `the technical documentation contains where relevant, the data requirements in terms of datasheets describing the training methodologies and techniques and the training data sets used, including a general description of these data sets, information about their provenance, scope and main characteristics; how the data was obtained and selected; labelling procedures (e.g. for supervised learning), data cleaning methodologies (e.g. outliers detection)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain where relevant, the data requirements in terms of datasheets describing the training methodologies and techniques and the training data sets used, including a general description of these data sets, information about their provenance, scope and main characteristics; how the data was obtained and selected; labelling procedures (e.g. for supervised learning), data cleaning methodologies (e.g. outliers detection)? Answer yes if it is not relevant.
      `the technical documentation contains an assessment of the human oversight measures needed in accordance with Article 14, including an assessment of the technical measures needed to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of AI systems by the deployers, in accordance with Article 13(3), point (d)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains an assessment of the human oversight measures needed in accordance with Article 14, including an assessment of the technical measures needed to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of AI systems by the deployers, in accordance with Article 13(3), point (d)?
      `the technical documentation contains where applicable, a detailed description of pre-determined changes to the AI system and its performance, together with all the relevant information related to the technical solutions adopted to ensure continuous compliance of the AI system with the relevant requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain where applicable, a detailed description of pre-determined changes to the AI system and its performance, together with all the relevant information related to the technical solutions adopted to ensure continuous compliance with the relevant requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2? Answer yes if it is not applicable.
      `the technical documentation contains the validation and testing procedures used, including information about the validation and testing data used and their main characteristics` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the validation and testing procedures used, including information about the validation and testing data used and their main characteristics?
      `the technical documentation contains the metrics used to measure accuracy, robustness and compliance with other relevant requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2, as well as potentially discriminatory impacts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the metrics used to measure accuracy, robustness and compliance with other relevant requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2, as well as potentially discriminatory impacts?
      `the technical documentation contains test logs and all test reports dated and signed by the responsible persons, including with regard to pre-determined changes as referred to under point (f)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains test logs and all test reports dated and signed by the responsible persons, including with regard to pre-determined changes as referred to under point (f)?
      `the technical documentation contains cybersecurity measures put in place` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains cybersecurity measures put in place?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex IV point 2, as a provider of an AI system, does the technical documentation of my high-risk AI system contain a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development, including the eight items the point lists` IS
    `Annex IV point 2 the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the technical documentation contains a detailed description of the elements of the AI system and of the process for its development` `the technical documentation contains the methods and steps performed for the development of the AI system, including, where relevant, recourse to pre-trained systems or tools provided by third parties and how those were used, integrated or modified by the provider` `the technical documentation contains the design specifications of the system, namely the general logic of the AI system and of the algorithms` `the technical documentation contains the key design choices including the rationale and assumptions made, including with regard to persons or groups of persons in respect of who the system is intended to be used` `the technical documentation contains the main classification choices` `the technical documentation contains what the system is designed to optimise for, and the relevance of the different parameters` `the technical documentation contains the description of the expected output and output quality of the system` `the technical documentation contains the decisions about any possible trade-off made regarding the technical solutions adopted to comply with the requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2` `the technical documentation contains the description of the system architecture explaining how software components build on or feed into each other and integrate into the overall processing` `the technical documentation contains the computational resources used to develop, train, test and validate the AI system` `the technical documentation contains where relevant, the data requirements in terms of datasheets describing the training methodologies and techniques and the training data sets used, including a general description of these data sets, information about their provenance, scope and main characteristics; how the data was obtained and selected; labelling procedures (e.g. for supervised learning), data cleaning methodologies (e.g. outliers detection)` `the technical documentation contains an assessment of the human oversight measures needed in accordance with Article 14, including an assessment of the technical measures needed to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of AI systems by the deployers, in accordance with Article 13(3), point (d)` `the technical documentation contains where applicable, a detailed description of pre-determined changes to the AI system and its performance, together with all the relevant information related to the technical solutions adopted to ensure continuous compliance of the AI system with the relevant requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2` `the technical documentation contains the validation and testing procedures used, including information about the validation and testing data used and their main characteristics` `the technical documentation contains the metrics used to measure accuracy, robustness and compliance with other relevant requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2, as well as potentially discriminatory impacts` `the technical documentation contains test logs and all test reports dated and signed by the responsible persons, including with regard to pre-determined changes as referred to under point (f)` `the technical documentation contains cybersecurity measures put in place`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

@export Under Annex IV point 3, as a provider of an AI system, does the technical documentation of my high-risk AI system contain detailed information about the monitoring, functioning and control of the AI system, in particular as to the four matters the point lists?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the technical documentation contains detailed information about the monitoring, functioning and control of the AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains detailed information about the monitoring, functioning and control of the AI system?
      `the technical documentation contains its capabilities and limitations in performance, including the degrees of accuracy for specific persons or groups of persons on which the system is intended to be used and the overall expected level of accuracy in relation to its intended purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains its capabilities and limitations in performance, including the degrees of accuracy for specific persons or groups of persons on which the system is intended to be used and the overall expected level of accuracy in relation to its intended purpose?
      `the technical documentation contains the foreseeable unintended outcomes and sources of risks to health and safety, fundamental rights and discrimination in view of the intended purpose of the AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the foreseeable unintended outcomes and sources of risks to health and safety, fundamental rights and discrimination in view of the intended purpose of the AI system?
      `the technical documentation contains the human oversight measures needed in accordance with Article 14, including the technical measures put in place to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of AI systems by the deployers` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the technical documentation contains the human oversight measures needed in accordance with Article 14, including the technical measures put in place to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of AI systems by the deployers?
      `the technical documentation contains specifications on input data, as appropriate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the technical documentation contain specifications on input data, as appropriate? Answer yes if it is not appropriate.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex IV point 3, as a provider of an AI system, does the technical documentation of my high-risk AI system contain detailed information about the monitoring, functioning and control of the AI system, in particular as to the four matters the point lists` IS
    `Annex IV point 3 the technical documentation contains detailed information about the monitoring, functioning and control of the AI system` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the technical documentation contains detailed information about the monitoring, functioning and control of the AI system` `the technical documentation contains its capabilities and limitations in performance, including the degrees of accuracy for specific persons or groups of persons on which the system is intended to be used and the overall expected level of accuracy in relation to its intended purpose` `the technical documentation contains the foreseeable unintended outcomes and sources of risks to health and safety, fundamental rights and discrimination in view of the intended purpose of the AI system` `the technical documentation contains the human oversight measures needed in accordance with Article 14, including the technical measures put in place to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of AI systems by the deployers` `the technical documentation contains specifications on input data, as appropriate`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

