@export Under Annex IV point 7, as a provider of an AI system, does the technical documentation of my high-risk AI system contain a list of the harmonised standards I applied in full or in part, or, where I applied none, a detailed description of the solutions I adopted to meet the requirements of Chapter III Section 2, including a list of other relevant standards and technical specifications applied?
