            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

§ `Under Article 4a: processing special categories of personal data for bias detection and correction`

@export Under Article 4a(1), as a provider of an AI system, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction in relation to my high-risk AI system?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the category is referred to in Article 9(1) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the category of personal data concerned one referred to in Article 9(1) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (racial or ethnic origin, political opinions, religious or philosophical beliefs, trade union membership, genetic or biometric data, health, sex life or sexual orientation)?
      `the category is referred to in Article 10 of Directive (EU) 2016/680` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the category of personal data concerned one referred to in Article 10 of Directive (EU) 2016/680?
      `the category is referred to in Article 10(1) of Regulation (EU) 2018/1725` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the category of personal data concerned one referred to in Article 10(1) of Regulation (EU) 2018/1725?
      `the processing is strictly necessary to ensure bias detection and correction in relation to high-risk AI systems in accordance with Article 10(2), points (f) and (g)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the processing is strictly necessary to ensure bias detection and correction in relation to high-risk AI systems in accordance with Article 10(2), points (f) and (g)?
      `appropriate safeguards for the fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons are in place` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that appropriate safeguards for the fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons are in place?
      `the provisions set out in Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable, are also complied with` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the provisions set out in Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable, are also complied with?
      `the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data?
      `the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation?
      `the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations?
      `the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties?
      `the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first?
      `the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4a(1), as a provider of an AI system, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction in relation to my high-risk AI system` IS
    `Art 4a(1) the provider may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` TRUE (`Art 3(37) the category is a special category of personal data` `the category is referred to in Article 9(1) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679` `the category is referred to in Article 10 of Directive (EU) 2016/680` `the category is referred to in Article 10(1) of Regulation (EU) 2018/1725`) `the processing is strictly necessary to ensure bias detection and correction in relation to high-risk AI systems in accordance with Article 10(2), points (f) and (g)` `appropriate safeguards for the fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons are in place` `the provisions set out in Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable, are also complied with` `the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data` `the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation` `the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations` `the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties` `the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first` `the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data`

@export Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of an AI system, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction, where my AI system is not a high-risk AI system?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the category is referred to in Article 9(1) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the category of personal data concerned one referred to in Article 9(1) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (racial or ethnic origin, political opinions, religious or philosophical beliefs, trade union membership, genetic or biometric data, health, sex life or sexual orientation)?
      `the category is referred to in Article 10 of Directive (EU) 2016/680` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the category of personal data concerned one referred to in Article 10 of Directive (EU) 2016/680?
      `the category is referred to in Article 10(1) of Regulation (EU) 2018/1725` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the category of personal data concerned one referred to in Article 10(1) of Regulation (EU) 2018/1725?
      `such processing is strictly necessary to ensure bias detection and correction in view of possible biases that are likely to affect the health and safety of persons, have a negative impact on fundamental rights or lead to discrimination prohibited pursuant to Union law, especially where data outputs influence inputs for future operations` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that such processing is strictly necessary to ensure bias detection and correction in view of possible biases that are likely to affect the health and safety of persons, have a negative impact on fundamental rights or lead to discrimination prohibited pursuant to Union law, especially where data outputs influence inputs for future operations?
      `appropriate safeguards for the fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons are in place` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that appropriate safeguards for the fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons are in place?
      `the provisions set out in Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable, are also complied with` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the provisions set out in Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable, are also complied with?
      `the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data?
      `the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation?
      `the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations?
      `the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties?
      `the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first?
      `the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the processing you have in mind: is it the case that the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of an AI system, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction, where my AI system is not a high-risk AI system` IS
    `Art 4a(2) the provider or deployer may exceptionally process special categories of personal data` `the date asked` (`the route by which the AI system is high-risk` EQUALS `Route neither`) FALSE FALSE (`Art 3(37) the category is a special category of personal data` `the category is referred to in Article 9(1) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679` `the category is referred to in Article 10 of Directive (EU) 2016/680` `the category is referred to in Article 10(1) of Regulation (EU) 2018/1725`) `such processing is strictly necessary to ensure bias detection and correction in view of possible biases that are likely to affect the health and safety of persons, have a negative impact on fundamental rights or lead to discrimination prohibited pursuant to Union law, especially where data outputs influence inputs for future operations` `appropriate safeguards for the fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons are in place` `the provisions set out in Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable, are also complied with` `the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data` `the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation` `the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations` `the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties` `the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first` `the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data`

