§ `Under Article 9: the risk management system of a high-risk AI system`

@export Under Article 9(1), as a provider of an AI system, has a risk management system been established, implemented, documented and maintained in relation to my high-risk AI system?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `a risk management system has been established in relation to the high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that a risk management system has been established in relation to the high-risk AI system?
      `the risk management system has been implemented` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the risk management system has been implemented?
      `the risk management system has been documented` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the risk management system has been documented?
      `the risk management system has been maintained` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the risk management system has been maintained?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 9(1), as a provider of an AI system, has a risk management system been established, implemented, documented and maintained in relation to my high-risk AI system` IS
    `Art 9(1) a risk management system has been established, implemented, documented and maintained in relation to the high-risk AI system` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `a risk management system has been established in relation to the high-risk AI system` `the risk management system has been implemented` `the risk management system has been documented` `the risk management system has been maintained`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

@export Under Article 9(2), as a provider of an AI system, is my risk management system a continuous iterative process comprising the steps the paragraph lists?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the risk management system is a continuous iterative process planned and run throughout the entire lifecycle of the high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the risk management system is a continuous iterative process planned and run throughout the entire lifecycle of the high-risk AI system?
      `the process involves regular systematic review and updating` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the process involves regular systematic review and updating?
      `the process comprises the identification and analysis of the known and the reasonably foreseeable risks that the high-risk AI system can pose to health, safety or fundamental rights when it is used in accordance with its intended purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the process comprises the identification and analysis of the known and the reasonably foreseeable risks that the high-risk AI system can pose to health, safety or fundamental rights when it is used in accordance with its intended purpose?
      `the process comprises the estimation and evaluation of the risks that may emerge when the high-risk AI system is used in accordance with its intended purpose, and under conditions of reasonably foreseeable misuse` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the process comprises the estimation and evaluation of the risks that may emerge when the high-risk AI system is used in accordance with its intended purpose, and under conditions of reasonably foreseeable misuse?
      `the process comprises the evaluation of other risks possibly arising, based on the analysis of data gathered from the post-market monitoring system referred to in Article 72` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the process comprises the evaluation of other risks possibly arising, based on the analysis of data gathered from the post-market monitoring system referred to in Article 72?
      `the process comprises the adoption of appropriate and targeted risk management measures designed to address the risks identified pursuant to point (a)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the process comprises the adoption of appropriate and targeted risk management measures designed to address the risks identified pursuant to point (a)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 9(2), as a provider of an AI system, is my risk management system a continuous iterative process comprising the steps the paragraph lists` IS
    `Art 9(2) the risk management system is a continuous iterative process comprising the following steps` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the risk management system is a continuous iterative process planned and run throughout the entire lifecycle of the high-risk AI system` `the process involves regular systematic review and updating` `the process comprises the identification and analysis of the known and the reasonably foreseeable risks that the high-risk AI system can pose to health, safety or fundamental rights when it is used in accordance with its intended purpose` `the process comprises the estimation and evaluation of the risks that may emerge when the high-risk AI system is used in accordance with its intended purpose, and under conditions of reasonably foreseeable misuse` `the process comprises the evaluation of other risks possibly arising, based on the analysis of data gathered from the post-market monitoring system referred to in Article 72` `the process comprises the adoption of appropriate and targeted risk management measures designed to address the risks identified pursuant to point (a)`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

