§ `Under Article 10: data and data governance`

@export Under Article 10(1), as a provider of an AI system, is my high-risk AI system developed on the basis of training, validation and testing data sets that meet the quality criteria referred to in Article 10 and Article 4a(1)?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the high-risk AI system makes use of techniques involving the training of AI models with data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the high-risk AI system makes use of techniques involving the training of AI models with data?
      `training, validation and testing data sets are used` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that training, validation and testing data sets are used?
      `the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in paragraphs 2, 3 and 4 of this Article` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in paragraphs 2, 3 and 4 of this Article?
      `the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in paragraph 5 of this Article` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in paragraph 5 of Article 10? (Only the text as enacted, before 27 July 2026, refers to paragraph 5: it is not read for a later date.)
      `the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in Article 4a(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in Article 4a(1)? (Only the text as amended, from 27 July 2026, refers to it.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 10(1), as a provider of an AI system, is my high-risk AI system developed on the basis of training, validation and testing data sets that meet the quality criteria referred to in Article 10 and Article 4a(1)` IS
    `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the high-risk AI system makes use of techniques involving the training of AI models with data` `training, validation and testing data sets are used` `the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in paragraphs 2, 3 and 4 of this Article` `the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in paragraph 5 of this Article` `the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in Article 4a(1)`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

@export Under Article 10(2), as a provider of an AI system, are the training, validation and testing data sets of my high-risk AI system subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for its intended purpose, concerning each matter the paragraph lists?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the training, validation and testing data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose of the high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the training, validation and testing data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose of the high-risk AI system?
      `the practices concern the relevant design choices` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the practices concern the relevant design choices?
      `the practices concern data collection processes and the origin of data, and in the case of personal data, the original purpose of the data collection` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the practices concern data collection processes and the origin of data, and in the case of personal data, the original purpose of the data collection?
      `the practices concern relevant data-preparation processing operations, such as annotation, labelling, cleaning, updating, enrichment and aggregation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the practices concern relevant data-preparation processing operations, such as annotation, labelling, cleaning, updating, enrichment and aggregation?
      `the practices concern the formulation of assumptions, in particular with respect to the information that the data are supposed to measure and represent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the practices concern the formulation of assumptions, in particular with respect to the information that the data are supposed to measure and represent?
      `the practices concern an assessment of the availability, quantity and suitability of the data sets that are needed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the practices concern an assessment of the availability, quantity and suitability of the data sets that are needed?
      `the practices concern examination in view of possible biases that are likely to affect the health and safety of persons, have a negative impact on fundamental rights or lead to discrimination prohibited under Union law, especially where data outputs influence inputs for future operations` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the practices concern examination in view of possible biases that are likely to affect the health and safety of persons, have a negative impact on fundamental rights or lead to discrimination prohibited under Union law, especially where data outputs influence inputs for future operations?
      `the practices concern appropriate measures to detect, prevent and mitigate possible biases identified according to point (f)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the practices concern appropriate measures to detect, prevent and mitigate possible biases identified according to point (f)?
      `the practices concern the identification of relevant data gaps or shortcomings that prevent compliance with this Regulation, and how those gaps and shortcomings can be addressed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the practices concern the identification of relevant data gaps or shortcomings that prevent compliance with this Regulation, and how those gaps and shortcomings can be addressed?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 10(2), as a provider of an AI system, are the training, validation and testing data sets of my high-risk AI system subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for its intended purpose, concerning each matter the paragraph lists` IS
    `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the training, validation and testing data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose of the high-risk AI system` `the practices concern the relevant design choices` `the practices concern data collection processes and the origin of data, and in the case of personal data, the original purpose of the data collection` `the practices concern relevant data-preparation processing operations, such as annotation, labelling, cleaning, updating, enrichment and aggregation` `the practices concern the formulation of assumptions, in particular with respect to the information that the data are supposed to measure and represent` `the practices concern an assessment of the availability, quantity and suitability of the data sets that are needed` `the practices concern examination in view of possible biases that are likely to affect the health and safety of persons, have a negative impact on fundamental rights or lead to discrimination prohibited under Union law, especially where data outputs influence inputs for future operations` `the practices concern appropriate measures to detect, prevent and mitigate possible biases identified according to point (f)` `the practices concern the identification of relevant data gaps or shortcomings that prevent compliance with this Regulation, and how those gaps and shortcomings can be addressed`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
            `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned`
            `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`

