      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation this question is about? Answer no if you do not know of such legislation.
      `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the application of the requirement or obligation this question is about leave the overall level of protection provided by this Regulation undiminished? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of accuracy` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of accuracy?
      `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of robustness` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of robustness?
      `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of cybersecurity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of cybersecurity?
      `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it performs consistently in those respects throughout its lifecycle` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For your AI system, is it the case that the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it performs consistently in those respects throughout its lifecycle?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 15(1), as a provider of an AI system, is my high-risk AI system designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently in those respects throughout its lifecycle` IS
    `Art 15(1) the high-risk AI system achieves an appropriate level of accuracy, robustness and cybersecurity and performs consistently` `the date asked` `the AI system as stated` `the harmonisation facts as stated` `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of accuracy` `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of robustness` `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it achieves an appropriate level of cybersecurity` `the high-risk AI system is designed and developed in such a way that it performs consistently in those respects throughout its lifecycle`
    WHERE
        `the AI system as stated` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the harmonisation facts as stated` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
