§ `Article 17`

@export Under Article 17(1), as a provider of an AI system, have I put in place a quality management system that includes at least the aspects listed in Article 17(1)?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) and related to a product covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if you do not know of such a product.
      `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Where the AI system is high-risk because of Article 6(1), does the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lay down requirements or obligations that give an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights than the requirement or obligation the question is about? Answer no if you do not know.
      `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the requirement or obligation the question is about leave the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation unreduced? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the quality management system ensures compliance with this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the quality management system ensures compliance with this Regulation?
      `the quality management system is documented in a systematic and orderly manner in the form of written policies, procedures and instructions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the quality management system is documented in a systematic and orderly manner in the form of written policies, procedures and instructions?
      `a strategy for regulatory compliance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include a strategy for regulatory compliance?
      `techniques for design, design control and design verification` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include techniques for design, design control and design verification?
      `techniques for development, quality control and quality assurance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include techniques for development, quality control and quality assurance?
      `examination, test and validation procedures and their frequency` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include examination, test and validation procedures and their frequency?
      `technical specifications, including standards, and the means to ensure compliance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include technical specifications, including standards, and the means to ensure compliance?
      `systems and procedures for data management` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include systems and procedures for data management?
      `the risk management system referred to in Article 9` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include the risk management system referred to in Article 9?
      `the post-market monitoring system in accordance with Article 72` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include the post-market monitoring system in accordance with Article 72?
      `procedures related to the reporting of a serious incident in accordance with Article 73` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include procedures related to the reporting of a serious incident in accordance with Article 73?
      `the handling of communication with authorities, notified bodies, other operators, customers or other interested parties` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include the handling of communication with authorities, notified bodies, other operators, customers or other interested parties?
      `systems and procedures for record-keeping of all relevant documentation and information` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include systems and procedures for record-keeping of all relevant documentation and information?
      `resource management, including security-of-supply related measures` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include resource management, including security-of-supply related measures?
      `an accountability framework for the responsibilities of the management and other staff` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your quality management system include an accountability framework for the responsibilities of the management and other staff?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under Article 17(1), as a provider of an AI system, have I put in place a quality management system that includes at least the aspects listed in Article 17(1)` MEANS
    `Art 17(1) the provider has put in place a quality management system that meets paragraph 1` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` `the quality management system ensures compliance with this Regulation` `the quality management system is documented in a systematic and orderly manner in the form of written policies, procedures and instructions` `the aspects`
    WHERE
        `the AI system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
            `date placed on the market or put into service` IS `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service`
            `route` IS `the route by which the AI system is high-risk`
            `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`
        `the circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
            `related to Section B products` IS `the AI system is related to products covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I`
            `Section A equivalent protection` IS `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection`
            `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation`
        `the aspects` MEANS `Art 17(1) what the quality management system includes` OF `a strategy for regulatory compliance`, `techniques for design, design control and design verification`, `techniques for development, quality control and quality assurance`, `examination, test and validation procedures and their frequency`, `technical specifications, including standards, and the means to ensure compliance`, `systems and procedures for data management`, `the risk management system referred to in Article 9`, `the post-market monitoring system in accordance with Article 72`, `procedures related to the reporting of a serious incident in accordance with Article 73`, `the handling of communication with authorities, notified bodies, other operators, customers or other interested parties`, `systems and procedures for record-keeping of all relevant documentation and information`, `resource management, including security-of-supply related measures`, `an accountability framework for the responsibilities of the management and other staff`

