      `limiting the requirement or obligation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Would limiting the requirement or obligation the question is about leave the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation unreduced? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the circumstances referred to in paragraph 1 occur` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the circumstances referred to in paragraph 1 occur?
      `the initial provider has clearly specified that its AI system is not to be changed into a high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you clearly specified that your AI system is not to be changed into a high-risk AI system?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
