        `the supply` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `what is supplied`, `the item is a general-purpose AI model`, `the item is used or integrated in a high-risk AI system`, `the third party makes the item accessible to the public under a free and open-source licence`, `the provider and the third party have a written agreement`, `the agreement specifies the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance based on the generally acknowledged state of the art, in order to enable the provider to fully comply with the obligations set out in this Regulation`

