      `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk` @desc Is the AI system high-risk because of Article 6(1) with Annex I, because of Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the AI system first placed on the market or put into service in the Union? If that has not happened yet, give the date you expect.
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the date from which Chapter III of the Regulation applies to your AI system, has its design been significantly changed? Answer no if you do not know of a significant change.
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the products to which your AI system relates covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I? Answer no if they are not, or if you do not know.
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation? Answer no if you do not know.
      `the quality management system has been assessed in accordance with point 3` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the quality management system has been assessed in accordance with point 3?
      `the technical documentation has been assessed in accordance with point 4` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the technical documentation has been assessed in accordance with point 4?
      `the approved quality management system is under surveillance in accordance with point 5` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the approved quality management system is under surveillance in accordance with point 5?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Annex VII point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is the conformity assessment the procedure based on points 2 to 5` IS
    `Annex VII point 1 the conformity assessment is the procedure based on points 2 to 5` `the date asked` `the route by which the AI system is high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` `the quality management system has been assessed in accordance with point 3` `the technical documentation has been assessed in accordance with point 4` `the approved quality management system is under surveillance in accordance with point 5`

