§ `Under Article 50`
-- SITUATION: This group arises only if the provider's AI system is of a kind Article 50 names (one intended to interact directly with natural persons, or one generating synthetic audio, image, video or text content); the form can first ask "Does your AI system interact with people, or generate synthetic content?".

-- Article 50(1): Art 50(1) the provider must ensure that the natural persons concerned are informed that they are interacting with an AI system
