      `the date the general-purpose AI model was placed on the market` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the general-purpose AI model first placed on the market in the Union?
      `the model is a general-purpose AI model` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the model is a general-purpose AI model?
      `the exception for free and open-source models of paragraph 2 applies to the provider` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the exception for free and open-source models of paragraph 2 applies to the provider?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
