      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the products to which your AI system relates covered by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I?
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have the requirements for high-risk AI systems under the Regulation been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation (the legislation listed in Section B of Annex I that covers the products)?
      `the provider is an SME, including a start-up` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the provider is an SME, including a start-up? Answer yes or no.
      `no fee is charged for access to the sandbox` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that no fee is charged for access to the sandbox? Answer yes or no.
      `the national competent authority recovers exceptional costs in a fair and proportionate manner` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the national competent authority recovers exceptional costs in a fair and proportionate manner? Answer yes or no.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 58, as a provider of an AI system, is my access to the AI regulatory sandbox free of charge as an SME` IS
