§ `Under Article 62: measures for SMEs`

-- These two questions arise only for a provider that is an SME, including a start-up.

-- Article 62(1)(a): SMEs, including start-ups, with a registered office or a branch in the Union have priority access to the sandboxes to the extent that they fulfil the eligibility conditions and selection criteria.
@export Under Article 62, as a provider of an AI system, has my Member State provided me, as an SME, with priority access to the AI regulatory sandboxes?
