      `the enterprise has a registered office or a branch in the Union` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the enterprise has a registered office or a branch in the Union? Answer yes or no.
      `the enterprise fulfils the eligibility conditions and selection criteria` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the enterprise fulfils the eligibility conditions and selection criteria? Answer yes or no.
      `the Member State provides the enterprise with priority access to the AI regulatory sandboxes` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the Member State provides the enterprise with priority access to the AI regulatory sandboxes? Answer yes or no.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 62, as a provider of an AI system, has my Member State provided me, as an SME, with priority access to the AI regulatory sandboxes` IS
    `Art 62(1)(a) the Member State has provided the SME with priority access to the AI regulatory sandboxes` `the date asked` `the enterprise is a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise as defined in Article 2 of the Annex to Recommendation 2003/361/EC` `the enterprise has a registered office or a branch in the Union` `the enterprise fulfils the eligibility conditions and selection criteria` `the Member State provides the enterprise with priority access to the AI regulatory sandboxes`

-- Article 62(2).
