      `the specific interests and needs of the SME providers, including start-ups, are taken into account when setting the fees for conformity assessment under Article 43` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the specific interests and needs of the SME providers, including start-ups, are taken into account when setting the fees for conformity assessment under Article 43? Answer yes or no.
      `the fees are reduced proportionately to their size, market size and other relevant indicators` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the fees are reduced proportionately to their size, market size and other relevant indicators? Answer yes or no.
