§ `Under Article 63: derogations for specific operators`

-- Article 63(1), first sentence. As enacted only microenterprises; as amended SMEs, including start-ups; in both versions only if the enterprise has no partner or linked enterprises.
@export Under Article 63, as a provider of an AI system, may I comply with certain elements of the quality management system required by Article 17 in a simplified manner?
