      `the enterprise is a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise as defined in Article 2 of the Annex to Recommendation 2003/361/EC` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your enterprise a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise as defined in Article 2 of the Annex to Recommendation 2003/361/EC?
      `the enterprise has no partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that your enterprise has no partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
