    `Art 63(1) the enterprise may comply with certain elements of the quality management system in a simplified manner` `the date asked` `the enterprise is a microenterprise within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC` `the enterprise is a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise as defined in Article 2 of the Annex to Recommendation 2003/361/EC` `the enterprise has no partner enterprises or linked enterprises within the meaning of Recommendation 2003/361/EC`

-- Article 63(2): paragraph 1 does not exempt from other requirements or obligations, including those of Articles 9 to 15, 72 and 73.
@export Under Article 63, as a provider of an AI system, is the requirement of Article N of the Regulation one that I must still fulfil even if I comply with the quality management system in a simplified manner?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `the number of the Article of this Regulation` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the number of the Article of the Regulation whose requirement you are asking about?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 63, as a provider of an AI system, is the requirement of Article N of the Regulation one that I must still fulfil even if I comply with the quality management system in a simplified manner` IS
    `Art 63(2) the Article is one of those whose requirements or obligations paragraph 1 does not exempt the operator from fulfilling` `the date asked` `the number of the Article of this Regulation`


§ `Under Article 64: the group of Chapter VII`

-- Chapter VII is mostly about officials. What it means to a provider: the national competent authorities may give guidance (Article 70(8)); the European Data Protection Supervisor supervises Union institutions (Article 70(9)). The group applies from 2 August 2025.

-- The applicability question for the provision group `Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Art 78` that Article 64 opens in this part's range: it asks only the date, and passes the core's constants for the route, the placement date and the change.
@export Under Article 64, as a provider of an AI system, does Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Art 78 apply on the date asked?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 64, as a provider of an AI system, does Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Art 78 apply on the date asked` IS
    JUST (`Art 113 the provision group applies` `Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Art 78` `the date asked` `the route to pass when no AI system is in question` `the date to pass when no AI system is in question` FALSE)


