    `Art 80(2) the market surveillance authority must require the provider to take all necessary actions and appropriate corrective action` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the market surveillance authority is carrying out the evaluation under Article 80(1)` `the market surveillance authority finds that the AI system concerned is high-risk`
